1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Pay attention.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:06,700
Your goal will be to rebuild a song in the correct order.

3
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:09,600
At the start, the complete song will play.

4
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:14,300
Use your tokens to discover what each terminal hides.

5
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:20,200
When you know which parts you need, you must register them in the correct order.

6
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:25,120
To register a part, press the green button before passing the token.

7
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:28,120
Repeat this until the song is complete.

8
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:33,646
Listen carefully, remember the order, and rebuild the song.
